@startuml 010-team-limit-50-class
title 010 team-limit-50：類別圖

class Activity {
  {static} MIN_TEAMS : int = 2
  {static} MAX_TEAMS : int = 50
  {static} DEFAULT_TEAMS : int = 4
  + teams : list[str]
  - _tokens : dict[str, str]
  - _codes : dict[str, str]
  + drafts : dict[str, dict]
  + configure_teams(count)  ' 只在 preparing；2 <= count <= 50
  + join(team) : str
  + release(team)
}

class TeacherTeamsRequest {
  + count : int
}

class TeacherView {
  + teams : list[str]
  + devices : map
}

class StudentView {
  + team : str | None
  + team_valid : bool
}

TeacherTeamsRequest --> Activity : configure_teams(count)
TeacherView ..> Activity : 讀完整 1–50 組
StudentView ..> Activity : 依身分裁切
note right of Activity
  合法改組數撤銷所有 tokens；
  組隊時另清除 codes 與 drafts。
  每組裝置上限仍為 6。
end note
@enduml
